  "description": "Give your AI assistant eyes AND hands on your logs. CSharpEssentials.LoggerHelper.MCP exposes 7 MCP tools over HTTP — letting Claude, Cursor, Copilot, and any MCP-compatible client inspect sink health, search logs, change log levels, and toggle sinks at runtime with natural language. New in 5.2.0: loggerhelper_set_log_level, loggerhelper_search_logs (queries the in-memory ring buffer), loggerhelper_toggle_sink — the only .NET logging library where AI can control logging, not just read it.",
